  <h2>Identify the vehicle before applying data</h2>
  <p>Record the engine designation and code, FWD or AWD architecture, transmission code, production date, market, brake package, wheel/tire specification, and relevant option codes. A trim badge alone does not establish component fitment.</p>
  <div class="note"><strong>Important:</strong> these pages are an independent reference, not factory workshop information. Do not infer fuse assignments, torque values, wiring pinouts, fluid capacities or part numbers from a similar model. Verify each against the correct VIN-specific Volvo source.</div>
